  "releaseNotes": "Breaking: events are serialized with the Orleans serializer instead of System.Text.Json, and delivered to every subscriber whose stream type they are assignable to. Event types must be serializable by Orleans ([GenerateSerializer], or a fallback such as AddJsonSerializer). Earlier versions cannot read the new format: for a rolling deploy set RedisStreamPublisherOptions.PayloadFormat = Json until every silo and client is upgraded. Entries already in Redis are still delivered. Full notes and upgrade guidance: https://github.com/MichaelSL/Universley.OrleansContrib.StreamsProvider.Redis/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
